 אֲבָל לֹא מַמָּשׁ.", "hebrew": "כאלו כן, אבל לא ממש.", "transcription": "keillu ken, aval lo mammash.", "ru": "Ну типа да, но не совсем.", "en": "Yeah kind of, but not really."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Неуверенное согласие.", "en": "Hesitant yes."}}, {"id": "slang-setam-sheela-187", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "סתם שאלה", "nikud": "סְתָם שְׁאֵלָה", "transcription": "setam sheela", "ru": "просто вопрос", "en": "just a question", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "סְתָם שְׁאֵלָה, אַתָּה פָּנוּי מָחָר?", "hebrew": "סתם שאלה, אתה פנוי מחר?", "transcription": "setam sheela, ata panu makhar?", "ru": "Просто вопрос: ты свободен завтра?", "en": "Just a question, are you free tomorrow?"}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Снять остроту вопроса.", "en": "Softens a question."}}, {"id": "slang-sheela-shel-rega-188", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "שאלה של רגע", "nikud": "שְׁאֵלָה שֶׁל רֶגַע", "transcription": "sheela shel rega", "ru": "на секунду вопрос", "en": "quick question", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "שְׁאֵלָה שֶׁל רֶגַע: אֵיפֹה הַשֵּׁרוּתִים?", "hebrew": "שאלה של רגע: איפה השרותים?", "transcription": "sheela shel rega: efo hasherutim?", "ru": "На секунду: где туалет?", "en": "Quick question: where's the bathroom?"}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Перед просьбой.", "en": "Before a request."}}, {"id": "slang-yalla-nu-189", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "יאללה נו", "nikud": "יַאלָּה נוּ", "transcription": "yalla nu", "ru": "ну же", "en": "come on already", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "יַאלָּה נוּ, אֲנַחְנוּ מְאַחֲרִים.", "hebrew": "יאלה נו, אנחנו מאחרים.", "transcription": "yalla nu, anakhnu meakharim.", "ru": "Ну же, мы опаздываем.", "en": "Come on already, we're late."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Подгоняет сильнее, чем одно יאללה.", "en": "Stronger hurry-up."}}, {"id": "slang-da-nu-190", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "די נו", "nikud": "דַּי נוּ", "transcription": "da nu", "ru": "да хватит уже", "en": "enough already", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "דַּי נוּ, שָׁמַעְנוּ אֶת זֶה.", "hebrew": "די נו, שמענו את זה.", "transcription": "da nu, shamanu et ze.", "ru": "Да хватит, мы это слышали.", "en": "Enough already, we heard that."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Нервное «хватит».", "en": "An irritated “enough”."}}, {"id": "slang-en-li-savlanut-leze-191", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "אין לי סבלנות לזה", "nikud": "אֵין לִי סַבְלָנוּת לְזֶה", "transcription": "en li savlanut leze", "ru": "нет на это терпения", "en": "I have no patience for this", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "אֵין לִי סַבְלָנוּת לְזֶה הַבֹּקֶר.", "hebrew": "אין לי סבלנות לזה הבקר.", "transcription": "en li savlanut leze haboker.", "ru": "Нет на это терпения сегодня утром.", "en": "I have no patience for this this morning."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Конкретный отказ от ситуации.", "en": "A targeted refusal."}}, {"id": "slang-khenuna-361", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "חננה", "nikud": "חְנֻנָה", "transcription": "khenuna", "ru": "ботаник", "en": "nerd", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "אַל תִּהְיֶה חְנֻנָה, בּוֹא לַמְּסִבָּה.", "hebrew": "אל תהיה חננה, בוא למסבה.", "transcription": "al tihye khenuna, bo lammsiba.", "ru": "Не будь ботаником, иди на вечеринку.", "en": "Don't be a nerd, come to the party."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "И ласково, и подкол.", "en": "Affectionate or teasing."}}, {"id": "slang-gobnik-362", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "ג'ובניק", "nikud": "גּ'וֹבְּנִיק", "transcription": "gobnik", "ru": "тыловик", "en": "desk soldier / jobnik", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "הוּא הָיָה גּ'וֹבְּנִיק בַּבָּסִיס.", "hebrew": "הוא היה ג'ובניק בבסיס.", "transcription": "hu haya gobnik babasis.", "ru": "Он был тыловиком на базе.", "en": "He was a jobnik on base."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Армейское, давно понятное гражданским.", "en": "Army slang, now widely understood."}}, {"id": "slang-pizum-363", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "פזם", "nikud": "פִּזּוּם", "transcription": "pizum", "ru": "выслуга / стаж", "en": "seniority", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "יֵשׁ לוֹ הַרְבֵּה פִּזּוּם בַּמַּקְצוֹעַ.", "hebrew": "יש לו הרבה פזום במקצוע.", "transcription": "yesh lo harbe pizum bammaktsoa.", "ru": "У него большой стаж в профессии.", "en": "He's got a lot of seniority in the field."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Армейское, на работе тоже.", "en": "Army, and at work too."}}, {"id": "slang-tafus-364", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "תפוס", "nikud": "תָּפוּס", "transcription": "tafus", "ru": "занято", "en": "taken / busy", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "הַשֻּׁלְחָן תָּפוּס, סְלִיחָה.", "hebrew": "השלחן תפוס, סליחה.", "transcription": "hashulkhan tafus, selikha.", "ru": "Столик занят, извините.", "en": "The table is taken, sorry."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Линия, стул, человек.", "en": "A line, a seat, a person."}}, {"id": "slang-hitpasti-365", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "התפסתי", "nikud": "הִתְפַּסְתִּי", "transcription": "hitpasti", "ru": "меня занесло / застрял", "en": "I got caught up", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "הִתְפַּסְתִּי בָּעֲבוֹדָה, סְלִיחָה.", "hebrew": "התפסתי בעבודה, סליחה.", "transcription": "hitpasti baavoda, selikha.", "ru": "Застрял на работе, прости.", "en": "I got caught up at work, sorry."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Не успел, потому что другое дело.", "en": "Late because something else grabbed you."}}, {"id": "slang-al-tenadned-366", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "אל תנדנד", "nikud": "אַל תְּנַדְנֵד", "transcription": "al tenadned", "ru": "не нуди", "en": "don't nag", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "אַל תְּנַדְנֵד, אֲנִי עַל זֶה.", "hebrew": "אל תנדנד, אני על זה.", "transcription": "al tenadned, ani al ze.", "ru": "Не нуди, я уже этим занят.", "en": "Don't nag, I'm on it."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Хватит повторять просьбу.", "en": "Stop repeating the ask."}}, {"id": "slang-nidnud-367", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "נדנוד", "nikud": "נִדְנוּד", "transcription": "nidnud", "ru": "нудёж", "en": "nagging", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "בְּלִי נִדְנוּד, אֲנִי שׁוֹמֵעַ.", "hebrew": "בלי נדנוד, אני שומע.", "transcription": "beli nidnud, ani shomea.", "ru": "Без нудежа, я слышу.", "en": "No nagging, I hear you."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Повтор одной и той же просьбы.", "en": "Repeating the same ask."}}, {"id": "slang-poza-368", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "פוזה", "nikud": "פּוֹזָה", "transcription": "poza", "ru": "поза / понты", "en": "attitude / posing", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "תַּורִיד פּוֹזָה, דַּבֵּר רָגִיל.", "hebrew": "תוריד פוזה, דבר רגיל.", "transcription": "tavrid poza, daber ragil.", "ru": "Сними понты, говори нормально.", "en": "Drop the attitude, talk normally."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Кто-то играет из себя.", "en": "Someone is putting on an act."}}, {"id": "slang-ze-lo-ze-369", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "זה לא זה", "nikud": "זֶה לֹא זֶה", "transcription": "ze lo ze", "ru": "это не то", "en": "it's not it", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "נִסִּינוּ, אֲבָל זֶה לֹא זֶה.", "hebrew": "נסינו, אבל זה לא זה.", "transcription": "nisinu, aval ze lo ze.", "ru": "Пробовали, но это не то.", "en": "We tried, but it's not it."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Отношения, работа, квартира не зашли.", "en": "A relationship, job, or flat didn't click."}}, {"id": "slang-en-kimya-370", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "אין כימיה", "nikud": "אֵין כִּימְיָה", "transcription": "en kimya", "ru": "нет химии", "en": "no chemistry", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "נְחְמָד, אֲבָל אֵין כִּימְיָה.", "hebrew": "נחמד, אבל אין כימיה.", "transcription": "nekhmad, aval en kimya.", "ru": "Приятный, но нет химии.", "en": "Nice, but there's no chemistry."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Про людей, не про уроки.", "en": "About people, not class."}}, {"id": "slang-latset-im-371", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "לצאת עם", "nikud": "לָצֵאת עִם", "transcription": "latset im", "ru": "встречаться с", "en": "to go out with", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "הִיא יוֹצֵאת עִם מִישֶׁהוּ.", "hebrew": "היא יוצאת עם מישהו.", "transcription": "hi yotset im mishehu.", "ru": "Она с кем-то встречается.", "en": "She's going out with someone."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Романтически, не «выйти вместе из дома».", "en": "Dating, not leaving a building."}}, {"id": "slang-gugel-et-ze-372", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "גוגל את זה", "nikud": "גּוּגֵל אֶת זֶה", "transcription": "gugel et ze", "ru": "загугли", "en": "google it", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "אַל תִּשְׁאַל אוֹתִי, גּוּגֵל אֶת זֶה.", "hebrew": "אל תשאל אותי, גוגל את זה.", "transcription": "al tishal oti, gugel et ze.", "ru": "Не спрашивай меня, загугли.", "en": "Don't ask me, google it."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Вместо объяснения.", "en": "Instead of explaining."}}, {"id": "slang-laasot-zum-373", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "לעשות זום", "nikud": "לַעֲשׂוֹת זוּם", "transcription": "laasot zum", "ru": "созвониться в зуме", "en": "to hop on Zoom", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "בּוֹא נַעֲשֶׂה זוּם בְּעֶשֶׂר.", "hebrew": "בוא נעשה זום בעשר.", "transcription": "bo naase zum beeser.", "ru": "Давай зумом в десять.", "en": "Let's hop on Zoom at ten."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Рабочая привычка.", "en": "A work habit."}}, {"id": "slang-lo-relevanti-374", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "לא רלוונטי", "nikud": "לֹא רֶלֶוַנְטִי", "transcription": "lo relevanti", "ru": "нерелевантно", "en": "not relevant", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "זֶה לֹא רֶלֶוַנְטִי לַיְּשִׁיבָה.", "hebrew": "זה לא רלונטי לישיבה.", "transcription": "ze lo relevanti lashiva.", "ru": "Это нерелевантно для совещания.", "en": "That's not relevant to the meeting."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Отсечь тему на работе.", "en": "Cut a topic at work."}}, {"id": "slang-dedlayin-375", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "דדליין", "nikud": "דֶּדְלַיִן", "transcription": "dedlayin", "ru": "дедлайн", "en": "deadline", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "הַדֶּדְלַיִן מָחָר בַּבֹּקֶר.", "hebrew": "הדדלין מחר בבקר.", "transcription": "hadedlayin makhar baboker.", "ru": "Дедлайн завтра утром.", "en": "The deadline is tomorrow morning."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "Английское, уже своё.", "en": "English, now local."}}, {"id": "slang-pidbek-376", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "theme": "slang", "hebrew": "פידבק", "nikud": "פִידְבֶּק", "transcription": "pidbek", "ru": "фидбек", "en": "feedback", "pos": "slang", "emoji": "💬", "example": {"nikud": "תִּתְּנִי לִי פִידְבֶּק אַחֲרֵי הַפְּגִישָׁה.", "hebrew": "תתני לי פידבק אחרי הפגישה.", "transcription": "titni li pidbek akhare hapgisha.", "ru": "Дай фидбек после встречи.", "en": "Give me feedback after the meeting."}, "audio": null, "usage": {"ru": "На работе и после урока.", "en": "At work and after a class."}}, {"id": "slang-sa-kevar-377", "deck": "slang", "level": "intermediate", "t